---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site, products } from "../config";
---
<Base title={site.name} description={site.tagline}>
  <section class="bg-ink text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-solar font-medium tracking-wide text-sm uppercase mb-4">Software engineering · .NET · Cloud · Data</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          We build the libraries.<br />We modernise the systems that use them.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/75 max-w-xl">
          SolTechnology is an engineering company with two branches: open, high-performance .NET libraries downloaded millions of times – and a consulting practice that takes real systems to the cloud, untangles data flows and makes processes measurable.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#products" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-solar px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-solar-dark transition">Products</a>
          <a href="#services" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition">Services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
        <img src="/brand/mark-animated-dark.svg" alt="" width="260" height="260" class="drop-shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(245,158,11,0.25)]" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="products" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 scroll-mt-20">
    <p class="text-solar font-medium tracking-wide text-sm uppercase">Products</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Libraries that earn their place in your pipeline</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted max-w-2xl">Small APIs, big throughput, no surprises. Every library ships with benchmarks, tests and public source. Free for individuals and small teams, licensed and supported for companies.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {products.map((p) => (
        <a href={`/${p.slug}`} class="group rounded-2xl border border-line p-7 hover:border-ink/30 hover:shadow-sm transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <img src={p.mark} alt="" width="56" height="56" />
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold group-hover:text-deep">{p.name}</h3>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm">{p.short}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] text-ink/80">{p.description}</p>
          <dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div><dt class="text-muted">NuGet downloads</dt><dd class="font-semibold">{p.stats.downloads}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="text-muted">Per day</dt><dd class="font-semibold">{p.stats.perDay}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="text-muted">Since</dt><dd class="font-semibold">{p.stats.since}</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </a>
      ))}
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-line p-7 text-muted flex items-center">
        <p>More libraries are on the way. Follow <a class="underline hover:text-ink" href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> for announcements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-mist p-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Free where it should be</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-[15px]">Noncommercial use and small businesses under 100 people and USD 1M revenue use every library at no cost, with no feature gates.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Licensed for companies</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-[15px]">Annual per-organisation licences with perpetual fallback: any version released while you are subscribed stays yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Source you can audit</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted text-[15px]">All code is public on GitHub, with benchmarks and tests. No telemetry, no phoning home, no hidden runtime checks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="bg-ink text-white scroll-mt-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
      <p class="text-solar font-medium tracking-wide text-sm uppercase">Services</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">From legacy to cloud, from guesswork to numbers</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-white/70 max-w-2xl">Senior engineers who have shipped high-throughput .NET systems in production – and who write the tools other teams depend on. We join your project where the risk is highest.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">Cloud migrations</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-white/70 text-[15px]">Moving .NET workloads to Azure or AWS without a big-bang rewrite: assessment, target architecture, phased migration, cost and reliability baselines before and after.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">System &amp; process analysis</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-white/70 text-[15px]">Mapping how data and work actually flow through your organisation, finding the bottlenecks and the manual steps, and turning the findings into a prioritised, costed roadmap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">Architecture &amp; performance</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-white/70 text-[15px]">Design reviews, profiling and allocation hunting for services that move a lot of data. Microservices, messaging, Kafka, Avro, schema evolution – with the numbers to back every recommendation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">Delivery &amp; enablement</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-white/70 text-[15px]">Hands-on development alongside your team, plus workshops on high-performance .NET, binary formats and benchmarking – so the knowledge stays when we leave.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-solar px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-solar-dark transition">Start a conversation</a>
        <span class="text-white/60 text-sm">Engagements are scoped individually and invoiced directly – not through the online store.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
